    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest of Dungeloria is a short metroidvania with elaborate locations. Forget about linear progression, the entire game world is a puzzle. The melancholy of a dying fantasy kingdom. Hardcore platforming, puzzles, bosses, gear items and a lot of secret places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/e5169bdcc439089031783fe79579931e.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=526 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/e5169bdcc439089031783fe79579931e.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nonlinear story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with the characters. Choose your response options. Kill, betray or spare. You are free to do whatever you want in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/bcb8c73e28f80470b0f15c20c13eb00f.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=370 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/bcb8c73e28f80470b0f15c20c13eb00f.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure-like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spirit of classic adventure point-and-click games, solving some puzzles requires some item hunting. Talk to NPCs to gain valuable clues and piece together the history of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/4654b809925eed6b7c5975c8955b03b4.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=416 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/4654b809925eed6b7c5975c8955b03b4.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active items grant the hero unique abilities, such as double jumping, attacking monsters, seeing hidden walls and more. Quick swap your equipment on the fly to adapt to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/a8b080042f03c3f1f2a959820fed6866.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/a8b080042f03c3f1f2a959820fed6866.apng?t=1750871134\" class=\"bb_img\" width=416 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Swap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve items in your inventory by finding flower pearls, giving you new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/95dbf8341605430552ed071789f19e6f.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/95dbf8341605430552ed071789f19e6f.apng?t=1750871134\" class=\"bb_img\" width=416 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old School gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively increasing difficulty ensures a properly hardcore experience. Quick reaction is king. No randomization, everything comes down to pure character control and focus.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest of Dungeloria is a short metroidvania with elaborate locations. Forget about linear progression, the entire game world is a puzzle. The melancholy of a dying fantasy kingdom. Hardcore platforming, puzzles, bosses, gear items and a lot of secret places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/e5169bdcc439089031783fe79579931e.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=526 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/e5169bdcc439089031783fe79579931e.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nonlinear story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with the characters. Choose your response options. Kill, betray or spare. You are free to do whatever you want in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/bcb8c73e28f80470b0f15c20c13eb00f.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=370 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/bcb8c73e28f80470b0f15c20c13eb00f.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure-like</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spirit of classic adventure point-and-click games, solving some puzzles requires some item hunting. Talk to NPCs to gain valuable clues and piece together the history of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/4654b809925eed6b7c5975c8955b03b4.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" width=416 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/4654b809925eed6b7c5975c8955b03b4.webm?t=1750871134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active items grant the hero unique abilities, such as double jumping, attacking monsters, seeing hidden walls and more. Quick swap your equipment on the fly to adapt to any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/a8b080042f03c3f1f2a959820fed6866.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/a8b080042f03c3f1f2a959820fed6866.apng?t=1750871134\" class=\"bb_img\" width=416 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Swap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve items in your inventory by finding flower pearls, giving you new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/95dbf8341605430552ed071789f19e6f.poster.avif?t=1750871134\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623580/extras/95dbf8341605430552ed071789f19e6f.apng?t=1750871134\" class=\"bb_img\" width=416 height=96 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old School gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively increasing difficulty ensures a properly hardcore experience. Quick reaction is king. No randomization, everything comes down to pure character control and focus.</p>",
